    "fileId": 38786,
    "type": "Table",
    "diagnosis": "",
    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Table&nbsp;2.29</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\"> Peutz&ndash;Jeghers syndrome cancer risks for specific anatomical localizations at 65&ndash;70&nbsp;years of age </span><span class=\"Ref-ID\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">{16707622}</span></span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Marnix Jansen",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 552.85pt; border-collapse: collapse;\" border=\"0\" width=\"737\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Site</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Lifetime risk</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Screening procedure and interval</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; border-left: none; border-image: initial; border-top: 1pt solid windowtext; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Initiation age (years)</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Colorectum</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">39%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">High-quality colonoscopy every 2&ndash;3 years; shorter intervals may be indicated based on polyp size, number, and pathology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Small intestine</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">13%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Small bowel visualization (video capsule endoscopy or CT/MRI enterography) every 2&ndash;3 years; shorter intervals may be indicated based on polyp size, number, and pathology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Stomach</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">29%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Upper gastrointestinal endoscopy every 2&ndash;3 years; shorter intervals may be indicated based on polyp size, number, and pathology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Pancreas</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">11&ndash;36%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Annual imaging of the pancreas with either EUS, MRI or magnetic resonance cholangiopancreatography (both ideally performed at a centre of expertise)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">~30&ndash;35</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Breast</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">32&ndash;54%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Mammogram and breast MRI annually; clinical breast exam every 6 months</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">~30</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Uterus</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">9%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Annual pelvic examination with endometrial biopsy if abnormal bleeding</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18&ndash;20</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Ovary</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">21%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Annual pelvic examination with annual pelvic ultrasound</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18&ndash;20</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Cervix</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">10%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Annual pelvic examination and Pap smear; consider total hysterectomy (including uterus and cervix) once childbearing is completed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">18&ndash;20</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 71.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"95\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Testes</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 104.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"139\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">9%</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 259.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"345\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Annual testicular exam and observation for feminizing changes</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 3pt 0cm; font-siz